Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 13:28:06 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Lean Adam: visibility-sparse update and bf16 SH-rest moments
 (stochastic rounding)

Adds adam_step_sparse (skips primitives with n_touched_tiles == 0 in the current view; optional
bfloat16 exp_avg/exp_avg_sq with stochastic rounding) and an n_touched_tiles export from the forward
pass. Enabled via TRAINING.OPTIMIZER.SPARSE_ADAM / SH_REST_BF16_MOMENTS; both default off, which keeps
the original adam_step path.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
